WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.550
Maxie: Can you come to the party?

2
00:00:06.551 --> 00:00:07.992
Jane: When is it?

3
00:00:07.993 --> 00:00:09.534
Taco: Tomorrow.

4
00:00:09.535 --> 00:00:11.972
Teddy: And what time is it?

5
00:00:11.973 --> 00:00:21.440
Maxie: 12:00.

6
00:00:21.441 --> 00:00:26.471
Taco: Who are you going to invite, Maxie?

7
00:00:26.472 --> 00:00:29.300
Happy: What do you want?

8
00:00:29.301 --> 00:00:33.668
Maxie: We want to invite you to a party.

9
00:00:33.669 --> 00:00:36.929
Smiley: Party? When is it?

10
00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:39.506
Maxie: Tomorrow at 12:00.

11
00:00:39.507 --> 00:00:46.525
Taco: Maxie! Are you crazy?

12
00:00:46.526 --> 00:00:52.383
Maxie: Let's get ready for the party.

